  "title": "Suisei no Gargantia",
  "justification": "AniDB specials S3-S15 \"Petit Gargantia 1-13\" and S16 \"Petit Gargantia: Special Project\" are TVDB season 0 episodes 1-14 \"Petite Gargantia 1-14\" on the same dates; S1 \"Abandoned Fleet\" (2013-08-09) is episode 15 and S2 \"Altar of the Visitor from Afar\" (2013-10-25) episode 16, same titles and dates. S17 \"Episode 1 Prologue\", S18 \"Episode 12 Opening\", S19 \"Episode 13 Opening\" and S20 \"Episode 13 Ending\" have no TVDB episode; S18-S20 fell by default on episodes 18 and 19 (the Far Beyond the Voyage OVA, AniDB 10549) and 20 \"Clean Openings\", so they are unmapped. TMDB 55011 season 0: E1-E14 Petite Gargantia 1-14 = S3-S16, E15 Abandoned Fleet = S1, E16 The Oracle's Altar = S2; its E17-E19 are the later Ocean Routes films and Li'l Recapantia, and it lists none of S17-S20. With no TMDB row S1-S20 took E1-E20.",
